<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Maytag Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.80 a share from $1.75 a share and set a 1998 estimate of $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- said said earnings gains in 1997 will be concentrated in the latter part of the year.</p>
<p>-- Maytag gained 1/8 to 21-5/8.</p>
</text>
